              "type": "math",
              "latex": "\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{1}{6},\\qquad \\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{12},\\qquad \\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{1}{20}",
